 "_about": "The Ullari woman at the pass-cord (act2_ch12.md side scene: 'an Ullari woman in layered weaving, middle-aged, plain, ties a knot onto the pass-cord... I carry the knot. He doesn't have to.'), about 50, of Quellan's highland Ullari (keth_pass.md; the knotted-cord records, glossary keth). Layered weaving: a long-sleeved oatmeal wool top, an ankle skirt in dark brown wool, a woven madder-red shawl over both (a solid shawl), an indigo striped sash, and a knotted cord on the left wrist (her keth). Black hair in a low knot with grey. Clips: tie_knot, touch_knot. M4-A2P-053. Face sliders relative to the MakeHuman donor (ADR 0021: 1.0 / 0.0 = unchanged). Keys starting with '_' are read by the villager_* modules, not by bb_params.",
